        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">London's PPC landscape is unlike anywhere else in the UK. Competitive terms in financial services, legal, and technology can cost far more per click than the UK average (our <a href="/blog/how-much-google-ads-cost-uk/" class="text-electric underline hover:text-electric-dark">UK Google Ads cost guide</a> shows CPC by industry), and the difference between a profitable campaign and a money pit often comes down to the granularity of your targeting, the quality of your ad copy, and how intelligently your bidding strategy responds to London's unique search patterns.</p>
